+config MEMORIA_BENCH_SERIAL
+    bool "Memoria bench build: screenshot and status over the USB console"
+    depends on BOARD_TYPE_MEMORIA_ESP_VOCAT
+    default n
+    help
+        Answer two read-only lines on the USB-Serial-JTAG console, `snap` (a screenshot of the display as
+        SNAP log lines) and `status` (one line of render and device state), so a computer can look at the
+        round screen with nobody at the robot. Test rigs only: the image carries a marker the firmware
+        publisher refuses, and flash.sh will not flash it without --bench. Never enable it for a product
+        image.
+
 endmenu
